senses.gloss:
sūtra, nt. (also sūtrānta, q.v.),
(1) (= Pali sutta) discourse, as a type of Buddhist sacred text (pravacana), one of twelve, Mvy 〔1267〕, or nine, Dharmas 〔62〕;
(2) also = sūtra-piṭaka, q.v. (= Pali sutta-piṭaka), the (collection of) discourses, one of the three grand divisions of the Buddhist canon: Mvy 〔1412〕; Divy 〔333.7〕; sūtravinayābhidharmeṇa Laṅk 〔290.8〕.

sūtra-pada,
(1) nt.? a sūtra text, or n. of some particular text (?): yathoktaṃ Bhagavatā ˚pade Mv 〔ii.98.13〕 (there follows a vs, = Pali Dhp. comm. 〔i.181.15 f.〕, 〔iii.30.19 f.〕, 〔319.14 f.〕);
(2) v.l. for Śvabhrapada, q.v.
